M_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。\\n任务规划：\\n1. 调用视频监控解析能力处理原始候选文本，提取摄像头编号、监控目标、区域标识、置信度及时间跨度等关键字段，构建标准化事件数据结构，为后续去重比对提供基准。\\n2. 基于视频监控场景的空间与设备匹配规则，比对各事件的ROI_A区域与摄像头标识，利用时间窗口重叠判定与置信度优先级机制，识别并合并同一摄像头下的重复记录，输出初步去重后的事件集合。\\n3. 依赖道路交通流量分析场景的时序连续性与多源一致性校验能力，对初步集合进行跨摄像头观测比对与置信度加权校准，剔除低置信度干扰项并统一时间边界，形成带可信度标注的唯一事件草案。\\n4. 整合前述处理链路结果，按唯一事件列表规范格式封装最终交付物，明确每条记录的独立索引、关联监控点位、综合置信度及生效时间段，并固化去重逻辑与置信度计算依据以支持系统回溯。\\n场景任务：\\n- video_surveillance: 处理CAM_1和CAM_2摄像头监控到的交通拥堵事件，根据时间和区域进行合并去重，生成唯一事件列表。；参数：{'视频对象': 'CAM_1, CAM_2', '监控目标': '交通拥堵', '区域': 'ROI_A', '置信度': '0.6, 0.9, 0.7', '时间范围': '10:00:00-10:00:20'}\\n- road_traffic: 分析并合并同一区域的交通拥堵事件候选，过滤重复项后输出唯一事件列表。；参数：{'分析区域': 'ROI_A', '时间范围': '10:00:00-10:00:20', '指标': '交通拥堵、置信度'}\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"road-traffic-analysis\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge\",\n    \"adapter_note\": \"Load the returned container_skill_file, follow its SKILL.md workflow, and use selected_data_sources/parameters as the legacy inputs.\"\n  },\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Read container_skill_file before executing the Skill workflow.\",\n    \"Use selected_data_sources and parameters as the legacy inputs.\",\n    \"After execution, call invoke_skill again with mode='wrap_output' to produce SkillResult.\"\n  ]\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"invoke_skill","id":"132fd9aa-177c-4d3d-99b2-fc8a21afd6be","tool_call_id":"call_317a220bb7bf4b9598f7c509","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":81,"prompt_tokens":15182,"total_tokens":15263,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":17,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":81},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":15182}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-c3f18632-c2e9-95c2-9175-aff08b6acf31","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e08-a6c3-7871-83ef-00a2c982a8f7-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取重复事件合并 Skill 的工作流程","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_becb953bc19a4304aad9f62c","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":15182,"output_tokens":81,"total_tokens":15263,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":17}}},{"content":"---\nname: duplicate-event-merge\ndescription: Merge duplicate video event candidates from the same camera, event type, ROI, evidence frames, or overlapping time window. Use after single-video-event-analysis or batch video analysis when Codex has a list of Event Candidate records and needs canonical events plus duplicate mappings.\n---\n\n# Duplicate Event Merge\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf event candidates are missing but the user provided a video or upstream analysis request, first call `single-video-event-analysis` to produce candidate events, then call this skill to merge duplicates. Only ask for input when no event candidates can be produced or inferred.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython duplicate-event-merge/scripts/run.py --events-json <events.json> --output <merged_events.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--events-json`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read event candidates.\n2. Build duplicate keys from camera, event type, ROI, and related tracks.\n3. Merge confidence and time range.\n4. Return canonical events and duplicate mapping.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `events`: list of Event Candidate dictionaries\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns:\n- `events`: canonical merged events\n- `duplicates`: mappings of `main_event_id` to `merged_event_id`\n\n## Failure Modes\n\nThe current implementation tolerates empty input and returns empty outputs.\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not drop evidence metadata from the canonical event.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"5406efba-63a2-4e58-9376-96f2aed30181","tool_call_id":"call_becb953bc19a4304aad9f62c","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在按 Skill 流程执行：先准备输入数据，再调用脚本。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":355,"prompt_tokens":15672,"total_tokens":16027,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":26,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":355},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":15672}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-29336afe-afc9-91f1-9781-098a3eabde1a","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e08-cd61-7760-8d2e-e32b72339cad-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"cat > /tmp/event_candidates.json << 'EOF'\n[\n  {\n    \"event_id\": \"evt_001\",\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_1\",\n    \"event_type\": \"交通拥堵\",\n    \"roi\": \"ROI_A\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.6,\n    \"start_time\": \"10:00:00\",\n    \"end_time\": \"10:00:10\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"event_id\": \"evt_002\",\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_1\",\n    \"event_type\": \"交通拥堵\",\n    \"roi\": \"ROI_A\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.9,\n    \"start_time\": \"10:00:05\",\n    \"end_time\": \"10:00:20\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"event_id\": \"evt_003\",\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_2\",\n    \"event_type\": \"交通拥堵\",\n    \"roi\": \"ROI_A\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.7\n  }\n]\nEOF\necho \"Input JSON created.\"","description":"将三条事件候选写入临时JSON文件"},"id":"call_a495836ef45c414285f0470c","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":15672,"output_tokens":355,"total_tokens":16027,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":26}}},{"content":"cat > /tmp/event_candidates.json << 'EOF'\n[\n  {\n    \"event_id\": \"evt_001\",\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_1\",\n    \"event_type\": \"交通拥堵\",\n    \"roi\": \"ROI_A\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.6,\n    \"start_time\": \"10:00:00\",\n    \"end_time\": \"10:00:10\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"event_id\": \"evt_002\",\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_1\",\n    \"event_type\": \"交通拥堵\",\n    \"roi\": \"ROI_A\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.9,\n    \"start_time\": \"10:00:05\",\n    \"end_time\": \"10:00:20\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"event_id\": \"evt_003\",\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_2\",\n    \"event_type\": \"交通拥堵\",\n    \"roi\": \"ROI_A\",\n    \"confidence\": 0.7\n  }\n]\nEOF\n\n\necho \"Input JSON created.\"\nInput JSON created.","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"da2627af-99a7-4b09-a012-05274f0eddd9","tool_call_id":"call_a495836ef45c414285f0470c","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":88,"prompt_tokens":16283,"total_tokens":16371,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":27,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":88},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":16283}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-2b55edf1-41b2-955d-afc3-152a4740949a","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e08-df63-7f22-af46-ab3f47763439-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"ls /mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/duplicate-event-merge/scripts/","description":"检查 Skill 脚本是否存在"},"id":"call_95789cb9e6ef40c4880f1685","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":16283,"output_tokens":88,"total_tokens":16371,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":27}}},{"content":"__pycache__  run.py","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"4b3522c2-2e0f-4dcd-ad7a-ef7b9cba7c2e","tool_call_id":"call_95789cb9e6ef40c4880f1685","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表：\n1) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.6 10:00:00-10:00:10\n2) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。","normalized_query":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表： 1) cam 1 交通拥堵 roi a 置信度0.6 10:00:00 10:00:10 2) cam 1 交通拥堵 roi a 置信度0.9 10:00:05 10:00:20 3) cam 2 交通拥堵 roi a 置信度0.7 第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。","routing_query":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表：\n1) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.6 10:00:00-10:00:10\n2) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{},"scene_mode":"multi","scenes":["video_surveillance","road_traffic"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_854a39","text":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表：\n1) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.6 10:00:00-10:00:10\n2) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_7f4589","text":"调用视频监控解析能力处理原始候选文本，提取摄像头编号、监控目标、区域标识、置信度及时间跨度等关键字段，构建标准化事件数据结构，为后续去重比对提供基准。"},{"task_span_id":"span_c0384f","text":"基于视频监控场景的空间与设备匹配规则，比对各事件的ROI_A区域与摄像头标识，利用时间窗口重叠判定与置信度优先级机制，识别并合并同一摄像头下的重复记录，输出初步去重后的事件集合。"},{"task_span_id":"span_153a78","text":"依赖道路交通流量分析场景的时序连续性与多源一致性校验能力，对初步集合进行跨摄像头观测比对与置信度加权校准，剔除低置信度干扰项并统一时间边界，形成带可信度标注的唯一事件草案。"},{"task_span_id":"span_40ae2c","text":"整合前述处理链路结果，按唯一事件列表规范格式封装最终交付物，明确每条记录的独立索引、关联监控点位、综合置信度及生效时间段，并固化去重逻辑与置信度计算依据以支持系统回溯。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_c2c7a9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"处理CAM_1和CAM_2摄像头监控到的交通拥堵事件，根据时间和区域进行合并去重，生成唯一事件列表。","params":{"视频对象":"CAM_1, CAM_2","监控目标":"交通拥堵","区域":"ROI_A","置信度":"0.6, 0.9, 0.7","时间范围":"10:00:00-10:00:20"}},{"sub_task_id":"sub_fb1ec6","scene":"road_traffic","scene_name":"交通流量","text":"分析并合并同一区域的交通拥堵事件候选，过滤重复项后输出唯一事件列表。","params":{"分析区域":"ROI_A","时间范围":"10:00:00-10:00:20","指标":"交通拥堵、置信度"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_c2c7a9","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"处理CAM_1和CAM_2摄像头监控到的交通拥堵事件，根据时间和区域进行合并去重，生成唯一事件列表。","params":{"视频对象":"CAM_1, CAM_2","监控目标":"交通拥堵","区域":"ROI_A","置信度":"0.6, 0.9, 0.7","时间范围":"10:00:00-10:00:20"}},{"sub_task_id":"sub_fb1ec6","scene":"road_traffic","scene_name":"交通流量","text":"分析并合并同一区域的交通拥堵事件候选，过滤重复项后输出唯一事件列表。","params":{"分析区域":"ROI_A","时间范围":"10:00:00-10:00:20","指标":"交通拥堵、置信度"}}],"task_hints":[],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:d71a3c8b-273a-458a-97af-a9a77d410bfb"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表：\n1) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.6 10:00:00-10:00:10\n2) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"我这里有三条事件候选，请合并成唯一事件列表：\n1) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.6 10:00:00-10:00:10\n2) CAM_1 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.9 10:00:05-10:00:20\n3) CAM_2 交通拥堵 ROI_A 置信度0.7\n第 1 条和第 2 条是同一摄像头同一区域的重复事件。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"road-traffic-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","road-traffic-analysis","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","road-traffic-analysis","roi-mapping","single-video-event-a